1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,700
Why did rocks in Death Valley's desert
move by themselves?

2
00:00:04,198 --> 00:00:06,900
For decades nobody saw them move,

3
00:00:07,300 --> 00:00:09,950
only long tracks in the ground.

4
00:00:10,617 --> 00:00:13,450
Scientists fitted the rocks with GPS.

5
00:00:13,995 --> 00:00:16,950
The secret: ice just three to six millimetres thin,

6
00:00:17,334 --> 00:00:19,750
which breaks up and glides in a light wind

7
00:00:20,030 --> 00:00:21,830
and pushes the rocks along.
